# User story (d), docs/upgrade/project_format3.md section 9.4: the data of story (b) as the EXFOR importer would add
# them, with the provenance fields and a covariance file for the correlated partial uncertainties.  The importer
# itself is not written yet; this is the record it is to produce.
<data>
dataset aC_RTH
    reaction       12C(a,a)12C
    quantity       rth
    unit           1
    file           data/exfor_aC_rth.dat
    columns        E_lab[MeV] theta_lab[deg] value error
    norm           1 fit prior 1 3%
    covariance     data/exfor_aC_rth.cov
    exfor          "entry subentry"
    doi            "10.0000/placeholder"
    source         "the EXFOR entry; ERR-S and U-flagged partials in quadrature"
</data>
